     1178   DEFINE BUFFER buf_Rule-profile FOR ub.rule-profile.
     1179   DEFINE BUFFER buf_Ruledict FOR ub.ruledict.
     1180   DEFINE BUFFER call_tt-rule-call-param FOR tt-rule-call-param.
